    "title": "SwordSlash",
    "description": "Welcome to SwordSlash, a thrilling new arcade game where each slash counts! Unleash your swords onto an array of round objects - from juicy fruit slices to gleaming moons, and watch them get sliced with finesse. As your skills sharpen, collect an assortment of fantastic sword skins to bring an extra dash of excitement to every game. With each round, the stakes are raised. Dive into SwordSlash, where precision meets excitement and every game promises a whirlwind of fun!!",
